title: "Prosthetic Hand Controller"
abstract: >-
  Grasp taxonomy, proportional myoelectric control, and a simulated force
  feedback loop, evaluated by closing on ten objects and measuring which are
  held against a fingertip friction coefficient the controller is never told.
